ult<bool, Stop> {\n        identities(self.theory(), tested)?;\n        cancellation.poll()?;\n        let mut work = Work {\n            limits,\n            cancellation,\n            statistics: Statistics::default(),\n        };\n        let mut values = reserve(self.truth.len())?;\n        self.satisfied_by(tested, &mut values, &mut work)\n    }","attr_info":{"attributes":[{"DocComment":" Whether `tested` satisfies every asserted root of this frozen reduct."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" `tested` may be any interpretation of the same admitted theory instance;"},{"DocComment":" it need not be a subset of the candidate. An independently admitted equal"},{"DocComment":" theory has a different identity and is refused before control is polled."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" For N DAG nodes and R asserted roots, a query charges N node evaluations"},{"DocComment":" and then one test per root through the first failure, at most N + R work."},{"DocComment":" It uses N temporary Boolean values, released on completion or stop. The"},{"DocComment":" freeze is reused unchanged. This is a fresh per-query budget, excluding"},{"DocComment":" construction and previous queries; `limits.max_subsets` has no effect."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" # Errors"},{"DocComment":" Returns wrong-theory, cancellation, deadline, allocation, or work-limit"},{"DocComment":" stops. A stop is not a logical rejection and leaves this reduct reusable."}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":true,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null,"diagnostic_item":null},"generics":{"regions":[{"index":0,"name":"'a","variance":"Unknown","mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":1,"name":null,"variance":"Covariant","mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":2,"name":null,"variance":"Covariant","mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":3,"name":null,"variance":"Covariant","mutability":"Unknown"}],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clauses":[],"regions_outlive":[{"regions":[],"skip_binder":[{"Var":{"Free":0}